SHAPEFILE_1_DEF T2019_KAR_STREET_NODE   shapefile_type               shapefile_point   NODE_ID                      long   LINK_ID                      long   POINT_NUM                    long   Z_LEVEL                      long   INTERSECT                    varchar(1)   LAT                          number(31,15)   LON                          number(31,15)
